OL,3,GNEWSABrass band bids to become national
OL,4,Achampions
OL,5,
OL,6,FA brass band is making final
OL,7,Fpreparations for its first bid to
OL,8,Fbecome national champions.
OL,10,FDorset's Verwood Concert Brass will
OL,11,Fplay at the Royal Albert Hall in London
OL,12,Fon Saturday 3 October.
OL,14,FIt is the first time the 162-year-old
OL,15,Fgroup has qualified for the
OL,16,FChampionship Section National Finals.
OL,18,FThird cornet player Jan Tiller, who
OL,19,Fjoined the band in 1980, said she had
OL,20,Fseen it rise from the fourth tier to
OL,21,Fthe highest rank of band competitions.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
